{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hollywoodbustoursla/items/333382/", "pk": 333382, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hollywoodbustoursla/", "pk": 54056, "shortname": "hollywoodbustoursla", "name": "Hollywood Bus Tours, LLC", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "A Taste of LA: Half Day Tour of the BEST of Los Angeles", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 9, "unicode": "A Taste of LA: Half Day Tour of the BEST of Los Angeles", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": true, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 0, "description": "#A Taste of LA: Half-Day Tour of the BEST of Los Angeles!\n\nExplore the best of Los Angeles on this 5.5-hour VIP-style sightseeing adventure, starting on the world-famous Hollywood Walk of Fame. With our fun and entertaining driver guide, you'll travel in a premium mini-coach to see LA's most iconic landmarks and neighborhoods, with some stops along the way, all in a convenient half-day format. \n\n#Four convenient stops to explore on your own! \n\n## #1 Beverly Hills & Rodeo Drive (30 Minutes):\nStop at the famous Beverly Hills Sign and soak up the heart of Beverly Hills. Snap photos, stretch your legs, and wander over to Rodeo Drive to see the luxury shops and legendary streets you’ve seen in movies and TV.\n\n## #2 Santa Monica Pier (45 minutes): \nSoak up the ocean breeze and take in the stunning views at this historic and lively coastal destination. Walk the pier, snap photos of the Pacific Ocean, and enjoy this quintessential LA experience. \n\n## #3 The Farmers Market & The Grove (60 minutes): \nTreat yourself to a delicious lunch at the historic Farmers Market and explore The Grove's stylish shops and vibrant atmosphere.\n\n## #4 Griffith Observatory & Hollywood Sign Views (30 minutes): \nEnjoy the last stop of your tour, which offers breathtaking views of Los Angeles from the Griffith Observatory. Capture the perfect photo of the iconic Hollywood Sign and enjoy panoramic city views.\n\n#What makes this tour unique?\n\n##Audio Guide / 11 Languages: (NEW) \nWe now offer this tour in 11 languages through a free multilingual app with pre-recorded audio commentary (not a live guide). English, Spanish, Portuguese, French, German, Russian, Italian, Catalan, Korean, Japanese, or Chinese. Our team will help you download the app to your smartphone and log in during check-in.\n\n##2025 Luxury Buses: (New) \n Travel in comfort and style aboard our brand new 2025 climate-controlled luxury coaches, perfectly designed for sightseeing & comfort! \n\n##Entertaining Driver Guide:\n Our knowledgeable guides bring LA to life with fascinating stories, fun facts, and local insights.\n\n##The ONLY Half-Day Tour in LA: \nUnlike competitors' tours, which last 7-9 hours (or longer with hotel pick-ups), we're proud to offer a streamlined, half-day option that gives you all the highlights without taking up your entire day. Don't miss this unforgettable way to see the best of Los Angeles! Book your spot today and enjoy the city's iconic landmarks, vibrant culture, and stunning views—all in one incredible tour!\n\n##Book with confidence:\n Hollywood Bus Tours is the #1 Sightseeing Experience in Los Angeles, with 15,000+ 5-star reviews (and counting!) and proudly holding the top spot on TripAdvisor! Book with the BEST!\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n#Know before you go!\n\n*The Tour begins and ends at the Hollywood Visitor Center, so you will have ample time to explore Hollywood before or after your tour!\n\n*Review the lunch and shopping options The Grove / The Farmers Market offers before you arrive to help maximize your time.\n\n*At The Griffith Observatory, you will have the BEST opportunity to take your must-have pictures of The Hollywood Sign. (Inside of The Griffith Observatory is closed on Mondays. You will still get to enjoy the outside & the Hollywood Sign viewpoint. Since we can’t go inside, you’ll enjoy extra time in Beverly Hills to stroll Rodeo Drive, shop, and soak up the glam at your own pace.)\n\n*The tour is approximately 5.5 Hours, with traffic permitting. However, LA traffic is one of a kind, lol. \n\n*We recommend checking the weather for the day of your tour & the listed websites for our stops to plan your activities.\n\n*Please arrive 15 minutes before your scheduled departure so the group can depart on time.\n\n*Your ticket includes a free Self-Guided Hollywood Walk of Fame Walking Tour in 11 languages! Our check-in staff will provide easy instructions to download the audio guide", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "7044 Hollywood Blvd, LA, CA, 90028", "booking_notes": "Thank you for choosing A Taste of LA: Half Day Tour of The Best of Los Angeles! \n\n###Reminders:\nThis Tour is on a New Comfortable Climate Controlled Luxury Bus that stops @ multiple locations where you will disembark the bus to explore, take pics, get food, shopping, etc - Top-rated guides will give you local tips, gossip, history and the best stories. We recommend checking the weather and planning accordingly. The tour will be 5.5 hours with traffic permitting. Please keep in mind LA traffic is one of a kind lol. \n\n###Additional Information:\n- Starts on the The Hollywood Visitor Center @ 7044 Hollywood Blvd. \n\nStops:\n- Beverly Hills @ Rodeo Drive - 30 Min Stop\n- Santa Monica - 45 minute stop\n- The Grove - 60 Minute stop (Shopping & Lunch)\n- Griffith Observatory - 30 minute Stop\n- Tour ends back on Hollywood Walk of Fame\n\n***We recommend parking at one of the two parking garages at 7021 Hollywood Blvd, Los Angeles, CA 90028, which is a short walk from our departure location. \n\nOn the day of your tour, we ask that your entire group checks in 15 minutes prior to your departure time inside The Hollywood Visitor Center to ensure the tour can leave on time. \n\nWe recommend checking our FAQ’s section if you have questions: \n\nhttps://hollywoodbustoursla.com/frequently-asked-questions/\n\nLooking for things to do while you are in Los Angeles? Check out our 40 Fun Things To Do in LA: \n\nhttps://hollywoodbustoursla.com/fun-things-to-do-in-hollywood/\n\nMeet us at 7044 Hollywood Blvd, Los Angeles, CA 90028", "cancellation_notes": "You may cancel your tour and receive a full refund within 24 hours of your scheduled departure time for full-price tickets only. For any tickets purchased below retail rate, all sales are final and no refund will be issued upon cancellation.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "5.5 Hours • 4 Stops • Audio Guide in 11 Languages", "short_description": "Half-day 5.5-hour VIP-style sightseeing tour of Los Angeles visiting Beverly Hills, Santa Monica Pier, The Grove/Farmers Market, and Griffith Observa​", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hollywoodbustoursla/items/333382/images/1652970/", "pk": 1652970, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/T5WYAXrVScjR4SNHb0BD", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/T5WYAXrVScjR4SNHb0BD", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hol